+
+
+# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- rule 21
+#
+# A SPELL SCRIPT THAT ASKS FOR A ROW THE TABLE DOES NOT HAVE ENDS THE SESSION.
+#
+# ~get_spell_data in magic.rs2 calls error("$spell_data is null.") when db_find comes back empty,
