+
+
+# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- rule 22
+#
+# ...AND A COMBAT SPELL ROW MISSING A FIELD THE CODE READS UNGUARDED ENDS IT THE SAME WAY.
+#
+# player_magic.rs2 guards most of the table with db_getfieldcount - sound_cast, sound_hit,
